{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8xOTk5LS1CZWZvcmUvQnJpZGUlMjBvZiUyMENodWNreSUyMCUyODE5OTglMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Bride of Chucky","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/yaIPNOcC7ZRuwH3maNwP9qzIo5G.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fLTd0VxpijUt6Hm1QM2ehLpWPeu.jpg","description":"For ten years, the tortured soul of serial killer Charles Lee Ray has been imprisoned inside a child's doll. 'Chucky' is reborn when his old flame, Tiffany, rescues his battered doll parts from a police impound. But Chucky wants his new playmate cut down to size, so he transforms his blushing bride into a stunning little terror. Chucky and Tiffany can't wait to start their own homicidal honeymoon. When this demonic duo hits the road and hooks up with a pair of unsuspecting newlyweds, they leave a trail of murder and mayhem behind them. Chucky's back!","releaseInfo":"1998","genres":["Horror","Comedy","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.1","runtime":"89 min","cast":["Brad Dourif","Jennifer Tilly","Katherine Heigl","Nick Stabile","Alexis Arquette","Gordon Michael Woolvett","John Ritter","Lawrence Dane"],"director":["Ronny Yu"],"released":"1998-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Chucky gets lucky.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Brad Dourif","character":"Chucky (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ex7AmuHM3owhUetYZAyOmN1ehWS.jpg"},{"name":"Jennifer Tilly","character":"Tiffany","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9vYoYF385cVq9oDO3pDpXihP4vz.jpg"},{"name":"Katherine Heigl","character":"Jade","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1yYJI5qtkeJMZo9JU4KMVuO2Hy9.jpg"},{"name":"Nick Stabile","character":"Jesse","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ihq0SPXmzMQlk1az9G60x4ukD05.jpg"},{"name":"Alexis Arquette","character":"Damien","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jNRBwGKXOZFWLI2ceff1sMUdxcE.jpg"},{"name":"Gordon Michael Woolvett","character":"David","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8fdk86FY8LjR9owIEJjtKX6ka